==========================================================================
READING RULE
==========================================================================
  This SUPERSEDES the coloc.abf verdict for MHC genes only. Outside the MHC,
  coloc.abf's single-causal-variant assumption is tenable and 10d stands.
  Report susie results as INDICATIVE, not definitive: the LD matrix is an
  out-of-sample 1000G EUR reference, and in the MHC an LD mismatch can create
  or destroy credible sets (Zou 2022). In-sample LD would be needed to settle
  the region, and neither eQTLGen nor Okada release it.
  A 'NOT RESOLVABLE' row is a statement about power and LD reference quality,
  never evidence of absence.

